# A scripted scene (dune_story_setup=gathering): the COMM room gathering of
# phase 0x0c (cs:1321). The first shot waits for " Continue..."; each tap
# presents the next topic-7 line.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 15000              # the story setup loads; the scene's first shot waits for Continue
checkpoint scene-shot
click left 160 80       # view = Continue: Leto “A communication room! Let's all gather here…”
wait 1200               # Leto's line shows
checkpoint scene-leto
click left 160 80       # view: Jessica “Thank you Leto, but let me tell you…”
wait 1200               # Jessica's line shows
checkpoint scene-jessica
click left 160 80       # view: the scene's second shot (the room)
wait 1200               # the shot draws
checkpoint scene-second-shot
quit
